  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Khordurn (central-dialect) reflexes of the Durnkad title ladder, ascending - the same seven ACKS tiers the Gormdurn and Khraaldurn share with only tiny drift. Borkun (clan-lord) barony; Vardrun (gate-warden) march; Grundar (delf-lord) county; Dramnar (great-lord) duchy; Brakkun (high-lord) principality; Korrun (king under the mountain) kingdom; Dur-Korrun (over-king) empire. A golden-age vault-kingdom, now fastness-holds.",
