      "Korrun": "Korra",
      "Vardrun": "Vardra"
    },
    "government": "feudal (an ancient vault-kingdom of clan-holds, now mostly fastness-holds; the Korrun under the mountain over the clan-lords, the rune-wardens and the hammer-companies)",
